WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.683 --> 00:00:01.910
- You know black don't crack, right?

00:00:01.910 --> 00:00:03.567
- No it don't, look at this.

00:00:03.567 --> 00:00:05.817
Look at this, look at this.

00:00:09.193 --> 00:00:10.026
- What's up y'all?

00:00:10.026 --> 00:00:10.966
I'm Daysha.

00:00:10.966 --> 00:00:11.828
- And I'm Pedro.

00:00:11.828 --> 00:00:14.305
- We're here at the 2016
BET Awards and we're

00:00:14.305 --> 00:00:16.400
going to play the black don't crack quiz.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.283
- Man, let's do it.

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:18.416
Come on, I'm ready.

00:00:18.416 --> 00:00:19.285
- Let's see what's up.

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:21.041
- [Voiceover] Which Pharrell
Williams is younger?

00:00:21.041 --> 00:00:23.273
- Oh, this is hard.

00:00:23.273 --> 00:00:24.375
- They look the same.

00:00:24.375 --> 00:00:25.569
- That's Pharrell in the future and

00:00:25.569 --> 00:00:26.598
that's Pharrell in the past.

00:00:26.598 --> 00:00:27.895
Ain't none of them from the present.

00:00:27.895 --> 00:00:28.728
- I know that's the younger one because

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:29.734
he got a fur on.

00:00:29.734 --> 00:00:31.349
- Ha! Yes!

00:00:31.349 --> 00:00:32.561
- I can look at the skin.

00:00:32.561 --> 00:00:33.901
- That's because he washing
his face with cold water.

00:00:33.901 --> 00:00:35.224
I read a lot about Pharrell.

00:00:35.224 --> 00:00:37.093
- [Voiceover] Which
Gabrielle Union is younger?

00:00:37.093 --> 00:00:39.646
- I don't want to get in trouble
picking the wrong one, bro.

00:00:39.646 --> 00:00:40.668
- Geez.

00:00:40.668 --> 00:00:42.887
- They look the same!

00:00:42.887 --> 00:00:46.201
- Come on, that's my baby right there.

00:00:46.201 --> 00:00:47.034
- Younger.

00:00:47.034 --> 00:00:49.566
(buzzer)

00:00:49.566 --> 00:00:50.636
- Damn.

00:00:50.636 --> 00:00:51.469
Okay.

00:00:53.423 --> 00:00:55.159
- Yeah, I said that one.

00:00:55.159 --> 00:00:56.761
- I got that wrong.

00:00:56.761 --> 00:00:58.402
- Oh my gosh, she's just beautiful.

00:00:58.402 --> 00:01:01.032
- See my eyes, didn't see
which one I was looking at.

00:01:01.032 --> 00:01:02.209
It was the wrong one.

00:01:02.209 --> 00:01:04.321
- [Voiceover] Which
Angela Bassett is younger?

00:01:04.321 --> 00:01:05.595
- Oh, that's hard.

00:01:05.595 --> 00:01:07.178
- This is not easy.

00:01:08.576 --> 00:01:09.409
- That one.

00:01:09.409 --> 00:01:10.242
- Nah.

00:01:10.242 --> 00:01:11.075
- No, no.

00:01:11.075 --> 00:01:12.404
- That one.

00:01:12.404 --> 00:01:13.619
(dings)

00:01:13.619 --> 00:01:14.452
(cheers)

00:01:14.452 --> 00:01:15.285
- Yes!

00:01:15.285 --> 00:01:17.529
- I know because she has that haircut now.

00:01:17.529 --> 00:01:19.840
- Either falling out or they
got to go with their short doo.

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:20.797
I know.

00:01:20.797 --> 00:01:21.630
I know.

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:23.608
- They both look beautiful.

00:01:23.608 --> 00:01:24.779
I love me some Angela.

00:01:24.779 --> 00:01:26.720
- I want to marry Angela Bassett.

00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:27.924
- Thank you for playing.

00:01:27.924 --> 00:01:29.120
- No problem.

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:30.537
Two out of three.

00:01:32.845 --> 00:01:34.798
- But you're right,
black don't crack, baby.

00:01:34.798 --> 00:01:37.307
We just glistening in the sun.

00:01:37.307 --> 00:01:38.924
Look like we been frying chicken.

00:01:38.924 --> 00:01:39.757
- I love being black.

00:01:39.757 --> 00:01:40.994
I'm black and I'm proud.

00:01:40.994 --> 00:01:42.807
Both of them.

00:01:42.807 --> 00:01:44.807
Look at me, I'm melanin.

00:01:45.783 --> 00:01:46.969
(creaking)

